        "quiz_type": "single_choice",
        "question_type": "single_choice",
        "question_title": "Let \\(\\vec a=2\\hat i-\\hat j+2\\hat k\\) and \\(\\vec b=\\hat i+2\\hat j+2\\hat k\\). The scalar projection of \\(\\vec a\\) on \\(\\vec b\\) is",
        "question_instruction": "Choose one correct option.",
        "explanation": "\\(\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b=2-2+4=4\\), \\(\\lvert\\vec b\\rvert=3\\). Hence the scalar projection is \\(\\frac{\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b}{\\lvert\\vec b\\rvert}=\\frac{4}{3}\\).",
        "question_audio": null,
        "time_limit_seconds": 30,
